Scope and exclusions

The MIT grant above covers the new code written for this repository. It does
not change the terms of the following material, which keeps its own status:

1. baselines/b1-vca13/supabase/** — byte-for-byte copies of files from Roy
   Harden's earlier app vibe-code-auditor (Bolt #13), commit
   fe0a10016ac8fef46d8fa66e080b03f087fad84d, plus the verbatim excerpts of that
   app's fetch-repo.ts transcribed in baselines/b1-vca13/selection.ts. That
   repository has no LICENSE file at that commit. These files are included
   only as a frozen comparison arm, under Roy Harden's explicit authorization
   for this app (recorded in baselines/b1-vca13/VENDORED.md). No licence is
   granted for them by this file. The other files in baselines/b1-vca13/
   (adapter.ts, mapping.json, deno-shim.d.ts, VENDORED.md) are new code under
   the MIT grant above.

2. src/shared/vendored/rng.ts, wilson.ts, entropy.ts — byte-for-byte copies
   from S26 Secret-Scan Triage, commit
   e971a5622947144d51f1fd5b7ca553bbf27e1a95, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
   Roy Harden. The S26 notice is reproduced in
   src/shared/vendored/VENDORED.md. src/shared/vendored/types.ts is new code.

3. corpus/** content is written by an independent corpus author and is
   released under the MIT grant above only through that author's attestation
   in docs/CORPUS.md.
